    "describe_ch": null,
    "describe_eh": "Let freshmen to quickly connect related industries, future careers and courses in our department. Learn about the current status of the department’s research and development and teaching in nanopolymer materials, fiber materials, composite materials, biomedicine, and dyeing, finishing and processing technologies. It also emphasizes the current application, research and development and teaching of fiber materials in the textile industry and composite materials. Through these courses, freshmen will be able to master relevant knowledge, understand future development paths, and prepare for future studies.",
